<title>FINLAND: STARCKJOHANN 1996 PROFIT FALLS 1.7 PCT.</title>
<headline>STARCKJOHANN 1996 PROFIT FALLS 1.7 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		  77.4 vs 78.7</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   0.62 vs 0.58</p>
<p> Net sales					3,079.7 vs 2,941.6</p>
<p> Operating profit				  91.4 vs 87.8</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation     151.8 vs 159.5</p>
<p> Depreciation					60.4 vs 71.7</p>
<p> Financial income				  19.5 vs 20.8</p>
<p> Financial expenses				33.5 vs 29.9</p>
<p> Extraordinary items				nil vs 52.8 charge</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	 77.4 vs 25.9</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    26.8 vs 21.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish steel wholesaler and car and</p>
<p>hardware retailer is Starckjohann Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0245</p>
